  "text": "proprium.sanctorum-innocentium-martyrum-secreta",
  "about": "The secreta of the formulary “The Holy Innocents, Martyrs” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Let not the gracious prayer of Your saints fail us, O Lord, but may it make our offerings acceptable to You and obtain for us Your mercy. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
